7104f7d-8HAVJb6B\"><col data-id=\"c62f8816-UKTUjNSe\" span=\"1\" width=\"30.52391799544419%\"/><col data-id=\"c5cf75b9-T2m19D7n\" span=\"1\" width=\"36.56036446469248%\"/><col data-id=\"cc25e418-D6hlDYPL\" span=\"1\" width=\"18.678815489749432%\"/><col data-id=\"ccb29c71-X7U1LniD\" span=\"1\" width=\"14.236902050113894%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-J7E0IC2Y\"><tr data-id=\"tca1b1fb-aFk8mfaN\" style=\"height: 43px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-MFpkRRD5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Cxk8brK7\"><strong>查询素材标签信息接口-问题素材字段</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-VRntCgRb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HoW8GPUA\"><strong>素材清理任务接口-清理素材类型字段</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-vLItIHGv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sNZmxBup\"><strong>是否需要创编营销</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-hKE2C6M3\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-H7RFRpmf\"><strong>素材是否在投</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"taeb9fd9-abPA3UXf\" style=\"height: 46px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-BycKzMfM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Zll8OH2d\">同质化素材风险-未投放预计排队素材</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-cShcdZy1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-G6uNe9JL\">无（该素材没有可投/绑定创意，不能清理）</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ERTsqyga\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7ndBZjyj\">否</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-NTdjDCjC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RyXOtEiV\">否</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-WSAT5Lo2\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-sALMlNQj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-EJQFQP8u\">同质化素材风险-排队投放素材</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-TP1LFUqY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ujOe4tT4\">同质化排队素材</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-hHGyeAFN\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ejYHrwKR\">是</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-FjZo20Ps\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vc04ntxU\">否</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-JkB39hbe\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-6fDB5E0U\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data